WHEREAS, for the general welfare and continued growth and prosperity of the Town of Sharpsburg, the Mayor and Town Council desire to amend Article II, Licensing, of Chapter 10 of the Town of Sharpsburg Alcohol Beverage Ordinance to allow the Licensing and establishment of License Fee for ancillary alcohol caterers; event permit for catered functions;

WHEREAS, the Mayor and Town Council have determined that in addition to promoting business growth in the Town of Sharpsburg, it is important to the general welfare and prosperity of the Town of Sharpsburg to assist in the economic development of the Town of Sharpsburg by maintaining existing business in the Town of Sharpsburg by allowing for the Licensing and establishment of License Fee for ancillary alcohol caterers; event permit for catered functions, in order to maintain business opportunities for smaller businesses operating in the Town of Sharpsburg;

